1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 19=

15
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:16,760
Shen Cheng.

16
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,720
Shen He.

17
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,480
It's you two, isn't it?

18
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,430
Perhaps you still don't know

19
00:01:24,310 --> 00:01:24,920
that your

20
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,760
loyal and honorable parents

21
00:01:27,510 --> 00:01:28,000
were killed

22
00:01:29,510 --> 00:01:31,920
by the poison on these arrows back then.

23
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:35,000
I wouldn't mind

24
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:38,080
reuniting your whole family
in the underworld.

25
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:44,670
Kill them.

26
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:01,120
You jerk.

27
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,560
If anything happens to you,

28
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,280
our next wedding will be held
at your grave.

29
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,390
Come up!

30
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,430
How could you...

31
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:08,910
Shut up.

32
00:02:08,910 --> 00:02:09,920
We'll settle this when we get back.

33
00:02:26,870 --> 00:02:27,480
Shen Cheng!

34
00:02:34,300 --> 00:02:35,440
Your Highness. Shall we pursue them?

35
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:37,390
No need.

36
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:38,990
He's been poisoned.

37
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,990
He won't survive the night.

38
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,200
Hurry.

39
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:50,030
Why does he keep

40
00:02:50,030 --> 00:02:51,670
getting poisoned like this?

41
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,360
Does this poison have legs

42
00:02:53,470 --> 00:02:54,760
and keep chasing him around?

43
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,110
The Imperial Physician said...

44
00:02:58,590 --> 00:03:00,000
He said the poison this time

45
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,670
has spread to all his vital organs.

46
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:02,990
It will take three days

47
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,200
to prepare the antidote.

48
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:06,080
I'm afraid...

49
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,090
♪Flowers in bloom♪

50
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,040
I'm afraid there's
nothing more we can do.

51
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:14,300
♪A gentle breeze♪

52
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:17,880
♪Taking your hand, so pure and gentle♪

53
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,760
Shutiao, you can save him, can't you?

54
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,870
Please, save him.

55
00:03:22,870 --> 00:03:23,880
Please save him.

56
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:26,200
I can only take a chance.

57
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:28,640
But in his current condition...

58
00:03:33,870 --> 00:03:35,910
♪The years of unspoken feelings♪

59
00:03:36,350 --> 00:03:39,350
♪Are quietly changing♪

60
00:03:40,650 --> 00:03:42,700
♪The distance between us♪

61
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:46,320
My blood can neutralize his poison.

62
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:50,450
♪Leaving yesterday's restraint behind♪

63
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:52,920
With what we have available now,

64
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,600
if we perform a blood exchange,

65
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,710
what are the chances of success?

66
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:01,080
A blood exchange?

67
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,200
Are you out of your mind?

68
00:04:05,570 --> 00:04:08,910
♪Watch as the bright moon slowly♪

69
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:12,530
♪Reflecting your face♪

70
00:04:12,750 --> 00:04:18,700
♪No longer hiding
the slightest urge to embrace you♪

71
00:04:19,510 --> 00:04:22,940
♪You are the most beautiful encounter♪

72
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,550
♪In all my years
of wandering through lifetimes♪

73
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:30,070
♪Hand in hand, we'll walk through♪

74
00:04:31,990 --> 00:04:36,080
♪Spring, summer, fall, and winter♪

75
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,030
You've really outdone yourself.

76
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,760
You usually complain
about even getting a shot.

77
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,320
But you went through
such a major operation

78
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,000
without batting an eye.

79
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:02,200
I'm telling you,

80
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,120
if you don't wake up soon,

81
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,950
when I get back,

82
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,160
I'll go shopping with the person

83
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,000
you hate most.

84
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:10,950
I'll only make myself
look good in our photos.

85
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:12,440
I won't tell you any gossip either.

86
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:16,440
I'll even get back together

87
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,800
behind your back

88
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,710
with that ex who gave me
the silent treatment.

89
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:21,660
That'll really make you mad.

90
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:34,080
Your Lordship, slow down.

91
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,470
Your wounds haven't healed yet.

92
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,200
Yuyuan...

93
00:05:44,270 --> 00:05:45,000
How is she?

94
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,910
She's lost too much blood.

95
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:47,510
She needs rest now.

96
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,880
The poison's out of your system.

97
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,510
You don't need her anymore.

98
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:52,950
You can leave.

99
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,440
Are you saying

100
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,830
she gave me her blood?

101
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,880
What else?

102
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,590
How do you think you woke up?

103
00:06:06,190 --> 00:06:08,000
Do you know how dangerous
a blood exchange is?

104
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:10,120
There's a fifty percent
chance both people could die.

105
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,760
Shen Cheng, I'm warning you.

106
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:17,880
If anything happens to Yuyuan,

107
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,680
I'll never forgive you.

108
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,120
Keep an eye on your master.

109
00:06:22,270 --> 00:06:23,080
Don't let him wander around.

110
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,000
If his wounds reopen,

111
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:27,200
not even the gods can save him.

112
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:27,830
Yes.

113
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,950
Shutiao.

114
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:04,080
Yuyuan, is she...

115
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,510
Yuyuan, please get better soon.

116
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:14,760
I picked these flowers for you.

117
00:07:25,070 --> 00:07:26,510
You're a dancing girl
from Wangyue Pavilion.

118
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,420
You're hurting me.

119
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,390
Are you saying

120
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,590
my sister

121
00:07:35,190 --> 00:07:37,350
is connected to the deaths
of the Marquis and his wife?

122
00:07:38,950 --> 00:07:40,150
During the Battle of Qiyun Pass,

123
00:07:40,830 --> 00:07:42,240
my parents died unjustly.

124
00:07:43,190 --> 00:07:44,910
They were also falsely accused
of disobeying military orders

125
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:46,560
and recklessly seeking glory.

126
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,640
They weren't that kind of people.

127
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,200
What's even more suspicious is that

128
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:50,680
on the day they died,

129
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,170
the dancing girls sent to
the military camp from Wangyue Pavilion

130
00:07:52,170 --> 00:07:52,830
all disappeared.

131
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,080
All these years,

132
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,950
we've been investigating in secret.

133
00:07:57,630 --> 00:07:58,710
But those who survived

134
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,640
have been killed one by one.

135
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:03,240
Now your sister is the only one left.

136
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,720
She's our only hope of clearing

137
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,030
my parents' names.

138
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:08,680
But my sister has been
mentally impaired for years.

139
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,760
She barely even recognizes me.

140
00:08:12,620 --> 00:08:13,930
We need to have
the Imperial Physicians examine her.

141
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,200
We must find a way
to restore her senses.

142
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,270
Come on.

143
00:08:25,270 --> 00:08:25,830
Dear.

144
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:26,800
No, listen.

145
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,200
It was an emergency.

146
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,390
If I hadn't

147
00:08:29,630 --> 00:08:30,800
gone along with his plan,

148
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,950
he would've gone alone.

149
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:33,350
Tell me,

150
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,590
how could I let Cheng

151
00:08:35,790 --> 00:08:37,080
go to his death alone?

152
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:37,590
Hmph.

153
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,560
So you chose your brother over me,

154
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:43,040
knocked me out,
and left me in a carriage.

155
00:08:43,790 --> 00:08:45,710
What a perfect solution for everyone.

156
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:46,800
Hmph.

157
00:08:47,270 --> 00:08:48,040
No.

158
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,400
Just look at me.

159
00:08:50,750 --> 00:08:51,710
Look at me.

160
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,440
Look at these dark circles.

161
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,200
I haven't slept well in three days.

162
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:57,110
I've been worried about you.

163
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:57,830
Serves you right.

164
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:01,110
Dear.

165
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,680
I deserved that.

166
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:11,040
Feel better now, Dear?

167
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:13,470
If not, you can headbutt me again.

168
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,160
Get lost.

169
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,950
Shen Cheng, you should leave.

170
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:26,870
Yuyuan said

171
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,160
she doesn't want to see you right now.

172
00:09:32,910 --> 00:09:34,800
He's been standing outside
for three days.

173
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,630
His wounds haven't fully healed.

174
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,710
His legs will give out
if he keeps standing there.

175
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,040
You really don't want to see him?

176
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:46,400
Feels good.

177
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:48,870
Nope.

178
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:50,630
I have to teach

179
00:09:50,630 --> 00:09:51,720
those two brothers a lesson.

180
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,870
That kind of

181
00:09:52,870 --> 00:09:53,630
arrogant,

182
00:09:53,630 --> 00:09:54,440
selfish,

183
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,120
controlling,

184
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,000
know-it-all,

185
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:56,630
self-important,

186
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:57,750
holier-than-thou attitude

187
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:58,870
needs to be

188
00:09:59,390 --> 00:09:59,950
nipped in the bud.

189
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:02,510
They never bother to communicate.

190
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:03,750
We have to teach them a lesson.

191
00:10:07,870 --> 00:10:09,590
Who are you teaching a lesson?

192
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,680
Those two rascals!

193
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,440
One dared to write a divorce agreement,

194
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:22,470
and the other went along
with his nonsense.

195
00:10:22,900 --> 00:10:23,420
They deserve it.

196
00:10:23,980 --> 00:10:24,930
They need to be taught a lesson.

197
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:40,590
Teaching men a lesson, is it?

198
00:10:41,270 --> 00:10:43,160
I've lived for seventy years.

199
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:44,920
I may not be good at much,

200
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,110
but this

201
00:10:46,630 --> 00:10:47,920
is my specialty.

202
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:48,800
I'll

203
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:49,680
help you.

204
00:10:51,410 --> 00:10:52,110
- Grandmother.
- Grandmother.

205
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:53,440
- What's your plan?
- What's your plan?

206
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:06,320
Cheng.

207
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:07,520
What's wrong with your leg?

208
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:08,870
Are you limping?

209
00:11:09,790 --> 00:11:10,110
Well...

210
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,080
It's gone numb from standing too long.

211
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,520
And what happened

212
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:18,920
to your nose?

213
00:11:21,390 --> 00:11:22,440
Must be the heat.

214
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:27,990
Shutiao

215
00:11:29,150 --> 00:11:30,710
has barely spoken to me for three days.

216
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:31,870
Same with Yuyuan.

217
00:11:32,510 --> 00:11:33,560
She won't even see me.

218
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,320
I never should've listened to you.

219
00:11:35,750 --> 00:11:37,320
You said sending them away
would keep them safe.

220
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:38,470
Well, they're safe,

221
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,040
but we've lost our wives.

222
00:11:41,790 --> 00:11:42,400
Your Lordship!

223
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:43,350
Something terrible has happened!

224
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:44,440
It's a disaster!

225
00:11:45,870 --> 00:11:46,350
Your Lordship.

226
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,320
Third Young Master.

227
00:11:47,750 --> 00:11:49,400
After learning about your divorces,

228
00:11:49,630 --> 00:11:51,440
Old Madam decided to find new husbands
for Yuyuan and Shutiao.

229
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,870
Now all the young gentlemen
from the capital

230
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,200
are gathered in the main hall.

231
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,140
- What?
- What?

232
00:12:00,210 --> 00:12:02,530
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

233
00:12:02,530 --> 00:12:09,730
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

234
00:12:09,730 --> 00:12:14,930
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

235
00:12:16,130 --> 00:12:21,170
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

236
00:12:22,530 --> 00:12:27,610
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

237
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:34,090
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

238
00:12:35,370 --> 00:12:38,730
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

239
00:12:57,490 --> 00:13:00,850
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
